\n\n[Button: Expand all]\n\nUsing Forms\n\nThe Judicial Council adopts legal forms in one of two ways. Under Government Code section 68511, the council may \"prescribe\" certain forms. Use of those forms is mandatory. The council may also \"approve\" forms. Use of an approved form is not mandatory, but the form must be accepted by all courts in appropriate cases (rule 1.35). If you need help to fill out the court forms online, please read our section on \"How to fill out court forms.\"\n\nTrouble viewing a file?\nFor information on how to view files, please view the FAQ on how to view files.\n\nFor more information on how to fill out forms, please visit the section \"How to fill out court forms.\"\n\nPlease note that our site currently does not support Chrome’s built-in PDF Reader. You may select another browser to view Forms, or disable the Chrome PDF Reader and select an alternate PDF Reader. Additionally, Adobe offers information on adding the Acrobat plugin to your browser.\n\nStatutory Forms\n\nThe forms below are provided for by the Legislature in statutes and are made available by the Judicial Council. Please refer to each form to locate the relevant statute for more information.\n\n \n\nForm  | Year  | Description\n--- | --- | ---\nCP10  | 2015  | Claim of Right to Possession and Notice of Hearing\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n| California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/find-forms?page=3&query=TH-)\nciteturn2178search10 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today;   * DE-351 * Order Appointing Guardian Ad Litem—Probate Effective: January 1, 2024\nSee form info Download\n\n  * DE-305 * Affidavit Re Real Property of Small Value Effective: January 1, 2026 汉语 한국어 español Tiếng Việt\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * DE-310 * Petition to Determine Succession to Primary Residence Effective: April 28, 2025 汉语 한국어 español Tiếng Việt\n\nSee form info Download\n\n  * DE-315 * Order Determining Successio